title: Vivian_LoadPhase
---
<<declare $gateOpen = false>>
<<declare $totalMaxwellsVivian = 0>>
<<declare $dialoguePhase_Vivian= "">>
<<setMaxwells Vivian>>
<<checkGate Vivian>>
<<if $totalMaxwellsVivian >= 9 && !$gateOpen>>
<<getPhase Vivian "questCompleted">>
<<endif>>
<<setPhase Vivian>>
<<if $dialoguePhase_Vivian == "begin">>
<<jump Vivian_Begin01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_Vivian == "comeback">>
<<jump Vivian_Comeback01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_Vivian == "questCompleted">>
<<jump Vivian_QuestCompleted01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_Vivian == "rewardGiven">>
<<jump Vivian_RewardGiven01>>
<<else>>
Vivian: Hey you didn't give me this dialogue yet!!
<<endif>>
===
title: Vivian_Begin01
---
<<camMove Vivian_CamRig "npc">>
Vivian: I hear that if you have 9 Maxwells this gate will open.
Vivian: I heard that because I'm the gatekeeper.
<<camMove Vivian_CamRig "pc">>
You: Noted!
<<camMove Vivian_CamRig "return">>
<<getPhase Vivian "comeback">>
===
title: Vivian_Comeback01
---
<<camMove Vivian_CamRig "npc">>
Vivian: That's right.
Vivian: *9* Maxwells is all you need to open this gate. 9.
<<camMove Vivian_CamRig "pc">>
You: Ok.
<<camMove Vivian_CamRig "npc">>
Vivian: So go get them.
<<camMove Vivian_CamRig "pc">>
You: Ok.
<<camMove Vivian_CamRig "npc">>
Vivian: Ok.
<<camMove Vivian_CamRig "return">>
===
title: Vivian_QuestCompleted01
---
<<camMove Vivian_CamRig "npc">>
Vivian: Well look at that! You got 9 Maxwells!
Vivian: I'll open the gate for you!
<<camMove Vivian_CamRig "pc">>
You: Great!
<<gateOpen Gate>>
<<camMove Vivian_CamRig "return">>
<<getPhase Vivian "rewardGiven">>
===
title: Vivian_RewardGiven01
---
<<camMove Vivian_CamRig "npc">>
Vivian: Before I could open the gate for you it spontaneously disappeared.
Vivian: This is definitely what happened. Definitely.
<<camMove Vivian_CamRig "return">>
===